/P 133 0 R
/T (Each output channel is individually fused, and a 5A fuse also protects the main power input. The design includes reverse-polarity protection via a P-channel MOSFET \(NTTFS5116PLTWG\) that blocks current if reverse voltage is applied, avoiding the forward voltage drop penalty of a series diode solution. Transient-voltage protection is implemented with a TVS diode that clamps at 40V to safeguard connected hardware from input voltage spikes.)
/E (Each output channel is individually fused, and a 5A fuse also protects the main power input. The design includes reverse-polarity protection via a P-channel MOSFET \(NTTFS5116PLTWG\) that blocks current if reverse voltage is applied, avoiding the forward voltage drop penalty of a series diode solution. Transient-voltage protection is implemented with a TVS diode that clamps at 40V to safeguard connected hardware from input voltage spikes.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [20]
>>
