/T (The objective of this project is to develop a hybrid viewfinder prototype that overlays an infinity-focused image in mid-air when looking through the viewfinder using custom-designed and manufactured optics.  This design utilizes two acrylic lenses, one concave and one convex, that make up an afocal system. This arrangement is similar to a simple Galilean telescope, just reversed to achieve a demagnification effect)
/E (The objective of this project is to develop a hybrid viewfinder prototype that overlays an infinity-focused image in mid-air when looking through the viewfinder using custom-designed and manufactured optics.  This design utilizes two acrylic lenses, one concave and one convex, that make up an afocal system. This arrangement is similar to a simple Galilean telescope, just reversed to achieve a demagnification effect)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3]
>>
