634 0 obj
<<
/Title (The objective of this project is to develop a hybrid viewfinder prototype that overlays an infinity-focused image in mid-air when looking through the viewfinder using custom-designed and manufactured optics.  This design utilizes two acrylic lenses, one concave and one convex, that make up an afocal system. This arrangement is similar to a simple Galilean telescope, just reversed to achieve a demagnification effect)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 343 0 R
/Next 737 0 R
>>
endobj
635 0 obj
<<
/Title (To achieve a HUD-like effect that focuses a display at infinity, a 45-degree beam splitter is used to project an image through the viewfinder. The design utilizes the rear lens element to focus the screen at infinity, which allows for everything in the viewfinder to be in focus at once.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 343 0 R
/Prev 737 0 R
>>
endobj
